MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- leaders.bibi.rule "המשפט" (reported mechanics, src trial / pardon-request); the
  content lint now requires rule.name / rule.text for every leader, the default too.
- Poll-number rule: "רוב" as a whole word (after up to two prefix letters) with a
  number near it is an error without poll_like; 61 and 120 (the Knesset's rules) pass,
  and substrings (קרוב, סירובים) never match. Applies to the About page too.
- R17: producers[].slot re-placed: no sky row (clipped under Row B), nothing under the
  thermometer column, the shared tiers' first critters right of the Magician and the
  first taxpayer clear of his hit. test_diorama_slots.gd checks the geometry.
- DAYS_* read "ימים בכותרות" and count court + press days
  (Investigation.hazard_days), so the result card fits every leader.
- Liberman: a fourth generic MK (mk_returner) on SK. His rounds 2+ had no seat that
  unlocks after election 1 and ran longer than round 1 (bench S5); round 1 is unchanged.

